<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's IEB cuts prime rate to 24.75pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's IEB cuts prime rate to 24.75pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Inter-Europa Bank said on Monday that it reduced its prime lending rate on forint loans to 24.75 percent from the current 26 percent, effective today.</p>
<p>Inter-Europa Bank is a member of Italy's San Paolo banking group.	 -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
